NeerRakshak — Hardware Components

Project Overview :

NeerRakshak is an ESP32-based smart water leakage detection system designed to detect leaks, alert users, and shut off the water supply automatically.

Main Hardware:

- ESP32 development board — main controller
- Water leakage sensor — detects the presence of leaked water
- Alert device — provides a warning when leakage is detected
- Relay module — controls the shut-off mechanism, if required by the final design
- Water shut-off actuator or valve — stops water flow
- Power supply — powers the circuit
- Connecting wires and prototyping materials

Assembly Status:

Not started yet.

Testing Status:

Pending.

Notes:

The final component list, pin connections, and operating details will be updated after checking the actual hardware available to the team.
